WEBVTT

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.460
How long do you think it's gonna take?

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.169
Two hours.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.296
It's never crashed on me before.

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:14.473
How long do you think it'll take
to scan this car?

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:15.432
Maybe 30 minutes.

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:19.519
I think I can do it in less than the
length of a YouTube video. 15 minutes.

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:25.359
Three, two, one, go.

00:00:27.361 --> 00:00:29.738
I'm so confident in my ability,
I'm not gonna rush.

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:30.989
I gotta take my time.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.497
Then when I'm done spraying the car,
show the watch.

00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:03.730
The corner of the left headlight.

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:07.150
You see how it's like
not fully covered?

00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:08.694
Time check.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.530
What? Oh, it's switched.

00:01:12.281 --> 00:01:14.157
Five minutes on the dot.

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:17.911
How you feeling halfway through it?

00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:18.954
It just crashed.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:22.541
Timer's still rolling.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.713
Yeah, once this is sorted out,
I'm just gonna start a new scan.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:31.967
So what happened?

00:01:32.301 --> 00:01:33.677
So the scanner crashed.

00:01:33.802 --> 00:01:35.595
After like a five minute delay,

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.641
We're rebooting it, and now
we're gonna try again.

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:41.143
All right, let's start there.

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.103
Start a secondary timer. Now.

00:02:10.005 --> 00:02:11.006
Are you still recording?

00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:13.258
Yep. So that's the exterior.

00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:15.510
That's done. Check mark.
What's the time?

00:02:16.219 --> 00:02:18.930
The cheating time is
8 minutes and 32 seconds.

00:02:19.097 --> 00:02:21.933
Front, hood, roof, right side.

00:02:22.684 --> 00:02:25.228
Rear quarter panel's a little messed up.
Roof's messed up.

00:02:25.771 --> 00:02:27.022
So I came back here, did

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:31.109
the whole roof, did the right
quarter panel,

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:32.194
fixed the trunk.

00:02:32.361 --> 00:02:33.278
That's the full interior.

00:02:33.487 --> 00:02:35.614
So now, if you wanna make a lip kit,

00:02:35.739 --> 00:02:39.618
let's jack the car up, do the fronts
and sides, wheel wells inside.

00:02:39.785 --> 00:02:40.494
So let's also time that.

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:49.169
For harder-to-reach areas,
I'll use the can.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:02.682
It's a crazy position.

00:03:03.892 --> 00:03:06.103
Is this the most optimal
scanning position?

00:03:06.478 --> 00:03:06.853
Yeah.

00:03:14.986 --> 00:03:17.280
Oh, under the car! It disappeared!

00:03:29.376 --> 00:03:29.960
Done?

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.294
Nope. Oh yeah, almost done.

00:03:40.971 --> 00:03:41.763
Time.

00:03:43.265 --> 00:03:44.307
20 minutes.

00:03:45.308 --> 00:03:46.101
Done.

00:03:47.269 --> 00:03:50.730
And the other one, 32 minutes.

00:03:51.106 --> 00:03:51.606
Yep.

00:03:54.484 --> 00:03:57.571
So one thing to note is also cleanup time.

00:03:57.779 --> 00:03:59.781
in that 20 minute span right here,

00:03:59.948 --> 00:04:02.993
most of the spray is already
off the hood, and

00:04:03.994 --> 00:04:04.744
it's already starting to...

00:04:33.815 --> 00:04:35.942
If we ignore the scanner crashing on me...

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.944
20 minutes. 20 minutes
for the whole car,

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.326
Yeah, this thing's fast.

